1
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,759
Why did Cheng An get hurt?

2
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,360
I'm asking you a question.

3
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,400
Why was Cheng An at the winery?

4
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:37,039
Instead of questioning me,

5
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,680
you should let the police investigate

6
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,000
those fruit farmers causing trouble.

7
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,000
Also,

8
00:02:43,759 --> 00:02:45,400
Aunt Lin, if you're not here to visit the patient,

9
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,400
then please leave.

10
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,000
I'm warning you,

11
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,680
Sang Luo.

12
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,080
Cheng An saved you

13
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,039
only because you're Brother Feng's daughter.

14
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,120
Don't get any funny ideas.

15
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,120
I'm sure

16
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,879
if you were the one injured today,

17
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,159
Little Uncle would have saved you too.

18
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,319
How is he?

19
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:39,840
Doctor?

20
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,719
The surgery went well.

21
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:41,639
He's very lucky.

22
00:03:41,639 --> 00:03:43,879
That nail almost pierced his kidney.

23
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,479
If it had, it would've been disastrous.

24
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:46,840
But the wound is too deep.

25
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,919
Combined with massive blood loss,

26
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:49,319
he is extremely weak right now.

27
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:50,599
He needs further observation.

28
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:53,759
If he can wake up within 48 hours,

29
00:03:53,759 --> 00:03:54,759
he'll be fine.

30
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:55,879
If he doesn't wake up,

31
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,000
then it's hard to say.

32
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,800
The patient still needs care.

33
00:03:58,960 --> 00:03:59,840
Which of you can stay with him?

34
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,199
Me.

35
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:00,680
I'll do it.

36
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:09,280
Little Uncle saved me,

37
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,879
so I'm staying.

38
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,680
What's your reason, Aunt Lin?

39
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:18,120
Once Cheng An wakes up,

40
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,680
please notify me immediately.

41
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,439
I told you to stir up the fruit farmers.

42
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,839
How did you end up hurting someone?

43
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:40,000
Now things have gotten out of hand.

44
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:40,720
If you get arrested,

45
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,800
I won't be able to protect you.

46
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,240
Find a place to lay low for a few days.

47
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,720
I'll arrange for you to go abroad in a few days.

48
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:50,079
Only this much money?

49
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:51,879
I can't leave the house.

50
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:53,560
I still need to eat and drink, right?

51
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,120
This will run out in no time.

52
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,439
Won't I have to go out anyway?

53
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:56,879
When that time comes,

54
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:59,040
it won't be good for you if I let something slip,

55
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,600
right?

56
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,160
Listen, don't push your luck.

57
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,600
Take the money, shut your mouth, and get the hell out.

58
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,360
Right away, right away, right away!

59
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:09,839
Are you done yet?

60
00:05:09,839 --> 00:05:10,600
Right away!

61
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:42,639
Xiaowei

62
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:45,079
What's wrong with Cheng An?

63
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,279
Xiaowei

64
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:49,759
Xiaowei

65
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:50,560
What?

66
00:05:52,319 --> 00:05:53,000
Xiaowei

67
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,040
Xiaowei

68
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,759
Recently,

69
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:15,600
Valley Breeze Group's oppression of fruit farmers

70
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,240
has continued to escalate.

71
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:18,000
It is reported

72
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,560
that the group maliciously breached the ice grape contract.

73
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,120
Many fruit farmers are suffering miserably.

74
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,360
Once the news broke,

75
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,480
it sparked widespread public attention.

76
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,839
Public anger is running high,

77
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:28,680
and Valley Breeze wine sales have plummeted.

78
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,519
Look at this.

79
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,240
What do we do now?

80
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,600
Mr. Cheng Yan,

81
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,319
you've only been in charge for a few days,

82
00:06:39,319 --> 00:06:40,839
and you've already caused such a huge mess.

83
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,800
How do you plan to resolve this?

84
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:45,879
Today,

85
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:47,560
calling everyone to this meeting

86
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,319
is exactly

87
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:50,240
to find a solution, isn't it?

88
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,839
As for Cheng Yan,

89
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:55,040
he just wanted to create more profit for the company.

90
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,480
His original intention was good.

91
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,759
It's just that

92
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,879
his methods

93
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,399
were a bit inappropriate.

94
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,720
Exactly.

95
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,399
Before, when the company's profits soared,

96
00:07:06,439 --> 00:07:07,720
wasn't everyone quite happy?

97
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,920
What kind of talk is that?

98
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:11,600
Valley Breeze Group values long-term interests.

99
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,079
Do we only look at short-term gains?

100
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,399
Mr. Li,

101
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,040
look, didn't you just say it yourself?

102
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,560
We're doing a long-term business.

103
00:07:20,199 --> 00:07:22,360
If our goods can't sell for a while,

104
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,639
isn't that also very normal?

105
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:25,000
"Can't sell for a while"?

106
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:28,000
What you're losing now is the group's reputation!

107
00:07:28,399 --> 00:07:30,519
Valley Breeze Group worked hard for decades

108
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:31,959
to build its current reputation.

109
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,439
And now it's about to be ruined by you!

110
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:35,920
For this matter,

111
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,759
someone must be held accountable.

112
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:42,879
Mom,

113
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,439
you said it yourselves,

114
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:50,439
Cheng Yan just took over the company a few days ago.

115
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,839
In such a short time,

116
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:53,680
he is unfamiliar with the business processes.

117
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,360
This is completely normal.

118
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:58,720
Previously, Cheng An managed all operations.

119
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,800
The current industrial adjustments

120
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:04,240
were also Cheng An's decisions.

121
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:07,120
That's what led to today's situation.

122
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,839
Madam,

123
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:10,319
the notice to halt the ice wine business

124
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:11,480
is clearly signed in black and white

125
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,879
with Cheng Yan's name.

126
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,519
The fruit farmers rioting at the estate

127
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:15,800
is also because of Cheng Yan.

128
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,839
Instead, Mr. Cheng An

129
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:19,319
got injured protecting the estate,

130
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:21,199
and is still unconscious in the hospital.

131
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:23,879
Are you in such a rush to shift the blame to him?

132
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:26,759
We must have a clear conscience

133
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:28,439
in how we conduct ourselves.

134
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,759
Watch out!

135
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:28,519
Are you okay?

136
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,879
I said I'm fine.

137
00:10:35,399 --> 00:10:36,200
That's good.

138
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,039
It's my fault for getting distracted.

139
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,600
Getting distracted?

140
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:43,639
At least you know.

141
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:46,559
Do you know you were wrong?

142
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,200
I really do.

143
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:53,399
Don't worry.

144
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,360
As long as I'm here,

145
00:10:54,759 --> 00:10:56,080
I won't let you get hurt.

146
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,039
Xiaowei

147
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:11,679
Little Uncle

148
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:12,559
You're awake.

149
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:15,000
I'm Sang Luo.

150
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:16,960
I'll go get the doctor.

151
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:40,320
So?

152
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:42,120
Ready for the next step?

153
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,279
Exposing their wine adulteration scandal.

154
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,279
It's time to begin.

155
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,879
But Cheng An got hurt saving you.

156
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,840
You're not getting soft, are you?

157
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:01,320
I'm not.

158
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:05,000
No one can stop my revenge plan.

159
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:12,919
Recently,

160
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,279
Valley Breeze Group was hit by a wine adulteration scandal,

161
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:17,159
causing a massive public uproar.

162
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:18,360
According to reliable sources,

163
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,200
a huge amount of Valley Breeze red wine on the market

164
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:22,039
is suspected of having severe quality issues.

165
00:12:22,039 --> 00:12:23,559
After random testing by professional agencies,

166
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:25,279
illegal additives were detected in the latest batch.

167
00:12:25,279 --> 00:12:25,799
Idiot!

168
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,320
Look what you've done!

169
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:31,759
Mom...

170
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,960
You can't blame this all on me.

171
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,679
Someone is definitely targeting me.

172
00:12:38,039 --> 00:12:39,279
Targeting Valley Breeze.

173
00:12:39,279 --> 00:12:40,679
The stock market reacted drastically.

174
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:41,840
Valley Breeze Group's stock price

175
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,919
suffered panic selling at the opening bell,

176
00:12:43,919 --> 00:12:44,879
taking a nosedive.

177
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,879
You short-sighted fool!

178
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,519
Are you trying

179
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:52,600
to ruin your father's and my life's work?

180
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:56,519
Mom,

181
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,919
I was wrong. I'm sorry.

182
00:12:58,919 --> 00:13:00,360
I really know I was wrong.

183
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:02,759
I just wanted to do something for the group.

184
00:13:02,759 --> 00:13:04,240
I wanted to save the group some money.

185
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:05,600
Mom,

186
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,159
please help me one more time, okay?

187
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,039
I'm begging you.

188
00:13:08,039 --> 00:13:08,679
Mom,

189
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,120
help me one more time!

190
00:13:12,399 --> 00:13:14,639
This mess is too big.

191
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,639
Even if I wanted to help you,

192
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,759
those people on the board

193
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,879
won't let you off the hook.

194
00:13:24,039 --> 00:13:25,600
If my eldest were still here,

195
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:29,840
how could I have possibly

196
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:32,320
pinned my hopes on you?

197
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:51,840
Cheng An

198
00:13:53,559 --> 00:13:55,080
Is your injury any better?

199
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,759
I was really worried about you.

200
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,399
Are you saying my injury has nothing to do with you?

201
00:14:02,559 --> 00:14:04,159
I didn't expect you to get caught in the crossfire.

202
00:14:04,879 --> 00:14:05,679
But,

203
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,960
it also proves my worth.

204
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:10,159
As long as you're willing to work with me,

205
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:12,080
I'll help you take back

206
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,639
everything in Valley Breeze that belongs to you.

207
00:14:13,919 --> 00:14:14,720
And then what?

208
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,720
Become someone

209
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,120
who, just like you,

210
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,360
stops at nothing to achieve their goals?

211
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,279
What's that supposed to mean?

212
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:24,320
A partner like you,

213
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:25,519
is someone I wouldn't dare take on.

214
00:14:44,039 --> 00:14:45,360
Do you have anything else to explain?

215
00:14:55,919 --> 00:14:57,639
Brother Feng and I lost our baby.

216
00:14:59,159 --> 00:15:00,399
I'm hurting more than

217
00:15:00,399 --> 00:15:01,320
any of you.

218
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,360
That was Brother Feng's and my flesh and blood!

219
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,799
We tried for so long

220
00:15:08,799 --> 00:15:09,879
to finally have this baby.

221
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,840
Everyone was so hopeful before he died.

222
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:14,919
I didn't want to keep it a secret.

223
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:16,639
But I didn't know how to say it.

224
00:15:16,799 --> 00:15:18,759
The old lady waited so long for a grandson.

225
00:15:19,879 --> 00:15:20,559
How could I just tell her,

226
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:21,200
"Mom,

227
00:15:21,799 --> 00:15:22,639
I'm sorry.

228
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,639
The baby is gone"?

229
00:15:29,919 --> 00:15:30,720
Xiao An,

230
00:15:31,679 --> 00:15:33,080
please give me a little more time,

231
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:33,840
okay?

232
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,399
The old lady is in poor health.

233
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,720
I don't want to upset her anymore.

234
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:52,039
Think carefully about this yourself.

235
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,120
How are you going to explain it to her?

236
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:21,159
Cheng An,

237
00:16:22,639 --> 00:16:24,200
You have a sharp tongue,

238
00:16:27,159 --> 00:16:29,120
but you still care about me.

239
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:35,159
After all these years,

240
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:40,120
you still can't let me go.

241
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,679
Because of the wine adulteration incident,

242
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:46,080
Valley Breeze suffered huge losses.

243
00:16:46,519 --> 00:16:48,039
The shareholders are investigating Cheng Yan.

244
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,159
He's already been suspended.

245
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:53,159
His suspension won't recover Valley Breeze's lost profits.

246
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:56,120
Right now, Valley Breeze is

247
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,080
leaderless.

248
00:16:57,399 --> 00:16:59,159
They desperately need someone to take charge.

249
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,159
It's time for you to go back, right?

250
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:02,600
There's no rush.

251
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,000
If I rush back now,

252
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:08,240
people will definitely think I'm

253
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:09,680
coveting power,

254
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,559
and overly eager.

255
00:17:11,359 --> 00:17:13,480
If the board continues to pressure the old lady,

256
00:17:13,759 --> 00:17:15,359
she'll definitely come to beg me personally.

257
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,559
Going back then

258
00:17:16,799 --> 00:17:18,079
will be the perfect timing.

259
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,599
You're always one step ahead.

260
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,640
By the way, you're just going to let Lin Wanmei off?

261
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,559
Those miscarriage records

262
00:17:27,559 --> 00:17:29,039
are great leverage against her.

263
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,160
If you just leaked them,

264
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:31,200
wouldn't that kick her out of

265
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,480
the game at Valley Breeze?

266
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:34,759
Don't be silly.

267
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,880
The situation at Valley Breeze is delicate now.

268
00:17:38,279 --> 00:17:40,319
Even though Cheng Yan has temporarily lost power,

269
00:17:40,599 --> 00:17:42,079
he still has the old lady backing him.

270
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,400
Right now,

271
00:17:44,759 --> 00:17:45,160
it's me,

272
00:17:46,599 --> 00:17:47,400
Cheng Yan,

273
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,039
and Lin Wanmei.

274
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,160
A three-way standoff,

275
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,119
keeping each other in check.

276
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,799
If Lin Wanmei falls,

277
00:17:56,839 --> 00:17:59,119
it'll just be me and Cheng Yan going head-to-head.

278
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,960
As for those old geezers on the board,

279
00:18:01,039 --> 00:18:03,440
there's no telling if they'll side with him.

280
00:18:04,799 --> 00:18:06,359
I'd be completely restricted then,

281
00:18:06,599 --> 00:18:07,480
unable to make a move.

282
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:10,079
Besides, there are more important things right now.

283
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:11,960
First, the fruit farmers caused trouble,

284
00:18:12,519 --> 00:18:14,000
which suddenly escalated into violence

285
00:18:14,119 --> 00:18:15,160
and destroying the orchards.

286
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:17,599
It seems like someone is pulling the strings

287
00:18:17,599 --> 00:18:18,559
and fanning the flames behind the scenes.

288
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,759
Then it was quickly exposed online.

289
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,440
Just when public opinion peaked,

290
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:24,599
the wine adulteration scandal suddenly broke out.

291
00:18:25,279 --> 00:18:26,599
It really does seem like someone is

292
00:18:26,599 --> 00:18:27,640
fanning the flames behind the scenes.

293
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,359
Exactly.

294
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:29,880
Things aren't that simple.

295
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:40,559
Eat your shrimp.

296
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:41,839
After you finish it,

297
00:18:42,079 --> 00:18:42,640
you have to do me a favor.

298
00:18:47,319 --> 00:18:48,119
Alright, alright, alright.

299
00:18:48,359 --> 00:18:49,359
Leave it to me.

300
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:04,720
Director Fang,

301
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,920
this is the miserable state of Valley Breeze today.

302
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:11,319
The stock price has plummeted to this extent.

303
00:19:11,599 --> 00:19:13,319
More than half of our partners have bailed.

304
00:19:13,839 --> 00:19:14,960
If this continues,

305
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:17,160
the group is really going to be finished.

306
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:17,880
Director Fang,

307
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:19,319
you have to come up with a solution.

308
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,079
What else can be done?

309
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,920
Given the current situation,

310
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:24,720
we still need to find someone

311
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,720
who is familiar with the business,

312
00:19:26,839 --> 00:19:28,400
has industry connections,

313
00:19:28,519 --> 00:19:31,279
and has the prestige to turn the tide.

314
00:19:33,119 --> 00:19:34,440
What are you still hesitating for?

315
00:19:34,640 --> 00:19:36,240
For this role, apart from Mr. Cheng An,

316
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:37,640
could there be anyone else?

317
00:19:39,079 --> 00:19:40,759
Cheng An is still recovering from his injuries.

318
00:19:41,119 --> 00:19:43,079
With this massive mess in the company,

319
00:19:44,039 --> 00:19:46,160
he might not be able to take over immediately.

320
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,680
Even if Mr. Cheng An is injured,

321
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:50,279
his remote command is better than Cheng Yan's.

322
00:19:52,359 --> 00:19:53,640
If you insist on standing in our way,

323
00:19:54,039 --> 00:19:55,279
then don't blame us

324
00:19:55,519 --> 00:19:58,200
for calling a shareholders' meeting to reshuffle the board.

325
00:19:58,279 --> 00:20:00,000
Are you threatening me?

326
00:20:29,640 --> 00:20:30,359
An'an

327
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:31,680
Mom.

328
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:32,839
Why are you here?

329
00:20:33,559 --> 00:20:35,119
How are you feeling?

330
00:20:35,359 --> 00:20:36,160
I'm good.

331
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:40,799
Much better.

332
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:42,680
It just hurts a little.

333
00:20:42,960 --> 00:20:43,640
Lean back.

334
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:44,440
Lean back.

335
00:20:47,039 --> 00:20:47,839
Why are you here?

336
00:20:47,839 --> 00:20:48,799
Aren't you busy at the company?

337
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:53,079
You've heard about what's going on at the company.

338
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:56,000
The stock plummeted recently,

339
00:20:56,319 --> 00:20:57,400
shareholders are pulling out,

340
00:20:57,759 --> 00:21:00,200
the warehouse is full of returns,

341
00:21:01,079 --> 00:21:03,400
and the production lines are mostly shut down.

342
00:21:06,599 --> 00:21:07,400
Xiao An,

343
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:10,480
your second brother can't handle things.

344
00:21:10,559 --> 00:21:13,000
The company still needs you.

345
00:21:13,279 --> 00:21:14,079
Mom,

346
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:16,440
you flatter me too much.

347
00:21:17,079 --> 00:21:18,240
Actually, the day Valley Breeze got into trouble,

348
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,720
I was thinking of contacting you.

349
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,359
But the doctor said

350
00:21:23,079 --> 00:21:24,359
I shouldn't overwork myself.

351
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:26,559
I have the will, but not the strength.

352
00:21:26,559 --> 00:21:27,359
But,

353
00:21:27,799 --> 00:21:29,680
Valley Breeze is your eldest brother's life's work.

354
00:21:30,359 --> 00:21:32,680
You can't bear to see it ruined, right?

355
00:21:33,799 --> 00:21:35,319
You've always been capable

356
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,720
and full of ideas.

357
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:37,960
As long as

358
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:46,440
you're okay,

359
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,279
just make an appearance,

360
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:51,400
and the staff will feel reassured.

361
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,279
The situation will also stabilize a bit.

362
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:56,400
You don't have to worry about other things.

363
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,279
After you've recovered,

364
00:21:57,279 --> 00:21:58,480
you can slowly reorganize things.

365
00:22:00,559 --> 00:22:02,559
I know this is hard on you,

366
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:04,119
but right now,

367
00:22:04,119 --> 00:22:07,839
the situation is really urgent.

368
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:12,079
I really have no other choice.

369
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:24,240
Mom.

370
00:22:26,319 --> 00:22:27,680
Since you put it that way,

371
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:32,000
I'll head back in a few days.

372
00:22:34,759 --> 00:22:35,559
Xiao An.

373
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:37,880
Hearing that puts my mind completely...

374
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,119
...at ease.

375
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:46,480
She took the bait.

376
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,759
You took care of me in the hospital these past few days.

377
00:23:12,079 --> 00:23:12,880
I really appreciate it.

378
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:16,319
Let me give you a ride back to the company on my way.

379
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:20,160
I should congratulate you first, Little Uncle.

380
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:22,720
On getting discharged?

381
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:23,400
Or

382
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:26,480
on returning to Valley Breeze?

383
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:27,640
Both.

384
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:31,640
And...

385
00:23:32,599 --> 00:23:33,720
thank you.

386
00:23:37,519 --> 00:23:38,680
During the incident at the winery that day,

387
00:23:39,599 --> 00:23:41,039
it was the first time I saw you so scared.

388
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:45,240
I thought I heard you say,

389
00:23:46,359 --> 00:23:47,119
"Dad...

390
00:23:47,119 --> 00:23:48,039
Don't hit me...

391
00:23:48,720 --> 00:23:50,200
Don't hit my dad."

392
00:23:51,279 --> 00:23:52,519
You must have misheard.

393
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:55,599
That day in the orchard,

394
00:23:56,759 --> 00:23:58,000
I suddenly thought of

395
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,480
when I was attacked by those thugs.

396
00:24:02,559 --> 00:24:03,359
Don't think about it anymore.

397
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:10,960
From now on,

398
00:24:11,279 --> 00:24:12,960
you won't ever be hurt again.

399
00:24:28,039 --> 00:24:29,000
The top priority

400
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:31,200
is to recall that batch of adulterated wine and destroy it.

401
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:32,920
Contact all major media outlets,

402
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:34,160
and hold a press conference

403
00:24:34,920 --> 00:24:36,519
to apologize for the wine adulteration incident,

404
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,839
and minimize its impact.

405
00:24:39,519 --> 00:24:41,440
At the same time, we must placate the upset fruit farmers.

406
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:45,000
In addition,

407
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:46,039
invite the media,

408
00:24:46,119 --> 00:24:46,960
distributors,

409
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:48,119
and consumers

410
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:49,640
to visit our brewing process

411
00:24:49,720 --> 00:24:50,839
and livestream the whole event.

412
00:24:52,279 --> 00:24:53,799
Meanwhile, on social media,

413
00:24:53,799 --> 00:24:54,920
release promotional materials

414
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:56,039
and initiate interactive discussions

415
00:24:56,039 --> 00:24:57,720
to rebuild Valley Breeze's brand image.

416
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:00,480
This is great! This is great!

417
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,000
This is wonderful!

418
00:25:02,319 --> 00:25:03,000
Mr. Cheng An,

419
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:03,720
look.

420
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:06,319
The tide of public opinion has completely turned.

421
00:25:06,319 --> 00:25:07,519
And our stock price

422
00:25:07,519 --> 00:25:09,359
has been rising steadily since morning.

423
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:13,079
The PR team did a fantastic job this time.

424
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:15,839
The shareholders are very satisfied

425
00:25:15,839 --> 00:25:16,799
with how you handled this crisis.

426
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,240
Old Li,

427
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:24,480
did you see?

428
00:25:24,880 --> 00:25:26,440
Valley Breeze's stock price went up again.

429
00:25:28,359 --> 00:25:29,640
This is really great!

430
00:25:37,039 --> 00:25:37,839
Hello?

431
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:40,440
I've looked into the ice wine issue.

432
00:25:48,839 --> 00:25:51,160
The data in this report is flawed.

433
00:25:52,039 --> 00:25:53,839
The cost of the ice wine business was inflated,

434
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:56,519
and the market forecast was suppressed.

435
00:25:57,039 --> 00:25:59,160
We both know the potential of the international market.

436
00:25:59,799 --> 00:26:01,559
When Cheng Yan saw a report like this,

437
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:03,519
he only had one choice.

438
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:05,480
The ice wine business was cut,

439
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,400
and the fruit farmers' contracts were voided.

440
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:09,559
The reputation Valley Breeze built in the industry

441
00:26:09,559 --> 00:26:10,799
will also plummet.

442
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:13,440
Behind the numbers

443
00:26:14,039 --> 00:26:15,319
are living, breathing people.

444
00:26:16,079 --> 00:26:16,880
Sang Luo,

445
00:26:17,519 --> 00:26:19,119
is this what you wanted to see?

446
00:26:22,319 --> 00:26:23,480
I've always trusted

447
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:27,000
your judgment of the industry.

448
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:28,599
But this time,

449
00:26:30,839 --> 00:26:32,279
you've really disappointed me.

450
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:07,200
What's wrong?

451
00:27:10,799 --> 00:27:12,440
Did I do the wrong thing?

452
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:15,799
If getting revenge means

453
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:17,759
hurting innocent people...

454
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:21,119
how am I any different from Lin Wanmei?

455
00:27:23,079 --> 00:27:24,119
You're overthinking this.

456
00:27:25,279 --> 00:27:27,200
Remember, they forced you into this.

457
00:27:27,559 --> 00:27:29,440
Everything you've done is just to protect yourself.

458
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,799
Right now, I can't even tell

459
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:34,759
if I'm Sang Luo or Ye Xiaowei anymore.

460
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,440
He's right.

461
00:27:39,920 --> 00:27:41,000
I was wrong.

462
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:42,559
You still have me.

463
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:45,680
The dirty work you don't want to do,

464
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:47,759
I'll handle it.

465
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:52,279
I can't let you bear so much.

466
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:59,680
And I can't lose myself anymore.

467
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:03,319
I am absolutely nothing like

468
00:28:04,319 --> 00:28:05,519
the people who hurt me.
